## 8. Finding the Greatest of Three Numbers

We can use an else-if ladder with logical AND to find the greatest number.

**Program:**

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    int a, b, c;

    cout << "Enter three numbers: ";
    cin >> a >> b >> c;

    if (a >= b && a >= c) {
        cout << "Greatest = " << a;
    }
    else if (b >= a && b >= c) {
        cout << "Greatest = " << b;
    }
    else {
        cout << "Greatest = " << c;
    }

    return 0;
}
```

